> I just downloaded NetHack for the first time... I'm a male human knight,
and I
> can't find a way down.  There are stairs up, and I've gone ALL over the
level
> over and over again, but there are no stairs down.  What should I do?

There are always stairs down, except on a few special levels, the first of
which you'll see is the end of the gnomish mines.

What you should do is, first of all, look under any objects that are lying
around.

Second, (s)earch around the level for secret doors -- especially if
there's a big empty space on your map somewhere.  It's fairly common to
find a level where the upstairs and downstairs are separated by a secret
door.

Third, if you have a method of digging (wand or pickaxe) dig down -- 
you'll fall into the next level, and then you can come back up when you
find the upstairs.



